---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Contact"
  description="How to contact InsureFacts by email about corrections, feedback or other questions. We can't give personal advice or help with insurance claims."
  lead="The best way to reach us is by email."
  ads={false}
>
  <p class="!text-xl">
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="font-semibold">
      {site.email}
    </a>
  </p>

  <h2>What you can contact us about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Errors or out-of-date information (see our <a href="/corrections/">corrections page</a>)
    </li>
    <li>Feedback or suggestions for topics we should explain</li>
    <li>Questions about this website</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we can’t help with</h2>
  <p>
    InsureFacts is not an insurance company, agent or broker. We can’t give personal advice, provide
    quotes, or help with a policy or claim. Please don’t send personal details, policy numbers or
    claim information by email.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you have a problem with an insurer, contact the insurer first. If it isn’t resolved, each
    country has official complaint and help services, which are listed in the “Official sources” box
    on each country page: <a href="/us/">United States</a>, <a href="/uk/">United Kingdom</a>,{' '}
    <a href="/ca/">Canada</a> and <a href="/au/">Australia</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
